=============================================
Project: GA Casino – Roulette MVP
Language: Python 3.10+
=============================================

Folder layout (suggested):

ga_casino/
├─ requirements.txt
├─ run.py
├─ config.py
├─ env/
│   ├─ grid.py
│   └─ roulette.py
├─ agents/
│   └─ gambler.py
└─ evolution/
    └─ ga.py

Paste each file into your project matching the paths above.
Then:
  python -m venv .venv && source .venv/bin/activate   (on Windows: .venv\Scripts\activate)
  pip install -r requirements.txt
  python -m viz.server


Notes:
- This MVP runs headless (CLI) and logs summary stats each generation.
- It uses a simple grid world + a single roulette table with a circular radius.
- Agents move randomly; if inside the table radius they must place a bet.
- Genome = small linear policy over simple features -> (bet type, bet fraction).
- GA = select top 50% by risk-adjusted return, clone+mutate to refill.
- Visualization: easy add later via Mesa or Matplotlib heatmaps; hooks/TODOs are marked.